<title>EGYPT: Egypt seeks 10,000 T palm stearin for March.</title>
<headline>Egypt seeks 10,000 T palm stearin for March.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian state's Food Industries Company said on Wednesday it wanted to buy 10,000 tonnes of Malaysian or Indonesian palm stearin for delivery in March.</p>
<p>The deadline for bids is noon (1000 GMT) on February 12. The quantity may be five percent above or below the 10,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
